  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 344
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 冲虚散人只是象征性地动作几下便已了事。而林沐雪却是仔仔细细地将纤纤玉手清洁干净，方才缓慢地抽回。让冲虚等得是极不耐烦，但当着宾客又不便发作。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 0
  AvatarID: {fileID: 0}
  AvatarIntID: 0
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
