--- !u!114 &114932651706073909
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1304510719906601}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 338
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 其右是林沐雪，她戴万载冰心石所铸繁复银色冠，以砗磲所产明珠为饰。又用灵气化扇，施然掩面。远而观之，如雾似幻，难窥真容；迫而察之，花容似玉，身段如娟。往下则着缟衣素袡，以红丝绣百鸟朝凤纹，上覆丝幜，尽显端庄。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 0
  AvatarID: {fileID: 0}
  AvatarIntID: 0
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
